k.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"LED Display","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>The LED display shows speed, distance, time, and calories. You can track your workout data in real-time and adjust your training pace to achieve an efficient workout.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_NnRWkE":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/T26B1_Merach_3_in_1_Laufband_12.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Weight Capacity 120KG","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>The Merach T26 treadmill utilizes the latest integrated die-casting technology from the automotive industry, making the frame extremely supportive and durable. It has a non-pressurized weight capacity of 120KG.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_cmGzgG":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/T26B1_Merach_3_in_1_Laufband_11.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Compatible Apps","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Merach, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health, Google Fit, Fanton Fite (By Merach)<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}}},"block_order":["item_77zXwN","item_FWiCMj","item_AUKXdT","item_HxLrkL","item_NnRWkE","item_cmGzgG"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"center","subheading":"","title":"","content":"","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"accordion_content_ABVBL4":{"type":"accordion-content","blocks":{"item_VcpLPc":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"none","icon_width":20,"title":"Controls and Functions","content":"<ul><li>Display: LED Screen<\/li><li>Motor: 2.75 HP<\/li><li>Speed\/Incline Settings: Speed (Remote Control) \/ Fixed Incline<\/li><li>Speed Range: 0.6 - 3.8 mph<\/li><li>Running Surface: 390 x 965 mm<\/li><li>Data Monitor: Speed, Time, Distance, Calories Burned<\/li><li>Foldable: No<\/li><li>Bluetooth